    cml:logicSummary "Requires a protected action ballot to be held" ;
    cml:premiseText "(1) This section applies if:  Rights and responsibilities of employees, employers, organisations etc.  Chapter 3 Industrial action  Part 3-3 Protected action ballots  Division 8 Section 447 Fair Work Act 2009 Compilation date: 02/04/2026" ;
